('O-2026-10-07-CL91-N3-T3-UNLOCK-ORPHAN','defect','N3 T3 branch unlock state has no writer','puzzles.n3.t3BranchUnlocked remains false and none of the 115 Lodge behaviors, shared kernel or 132 world macros references the flag; N3-to-T3 entrance gate is absent.','Reconcile authored N3 switch, cartography overlay and route-plate prerequisite semantics; explicitly approve gate behavior and destination placement before PREVIEW, guarded APPLY and independent FINAL VERIFY; separate live canary.','Canonical progression source naming exact unlock conditions, token event authority, branch Region topology, no-softlock and reversible canary design.','P0','blocked','Foreman','S-2026-10-07-CL91-STATEPATH-DEFECT-AUDIT'),
('O-2026-10-07-CL91-M1-CLOCK-SETTING-WRITER','defect','M1 grandfather clock setting still lacks canonical writer','Both clock compartment pickups now check puzzles.m1.clockSettingResolved, but no authored mechanism has been proven to set that canonical flag; the clock puzzle is not gameplay-certified.','Recover approved clock-setting rule and authored trigger, implement a source-guarded canonical gate/RegionBehavior, and independently verify before live canary.','Exact clock face solution, Region physical anchor, approved required action and DC/consent; tests showing key and baggage token only become available after valid setting.','P0','blocked','Foreman','S-2026-10-07-CL91-STATEPATH-DEFECT-AUDIT');
